> it does the work on its own separate Linux machine inside your Mac;
> information search, code, reminders, messages. And then reports the results back to you.

I think $DICTATOR is a really good name for such a project — it's not cute and friendly like every other AI assistant out there

> and that's exactly what makes it even cooler.

